    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the Market – Substantial 10-Bedroom Property with Commercial Space in Ballindine Village\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity presents itself with this three-storey mixed-use property located in the heart of Ballindine Village. Offering a total area of approximately 5,000 sq. ft., this property combines residential and commercial potential on a substantial site with large rear gardens and storage sheds.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n10 spacious bedrooms across three floors\r\n\r\nGround floor commercial shop space\r\n\r\nLarge enclosed rear garden with separate road access\r\n\r\nAdditional garden strip extending approx. 150m x 6m\r\n\r\nOil-fired central heating (OFCH)\r\n\r\nPVC windows and doors\r\n\r\nMains water and sewage\r\n\r\nRefurbishment Required – Offers fantastic scope to redevelop into:\r\n\r\nApartments\r\n\r\nFamily home with business potential\r\n\r\nRetail or mixed-use premises\r\n\r\nPrime Location:\r\n\r\n5 minutes to Claremorris\r\n\r\n15 minutes to Tuam\r\n\r\n25 minutes to Ireland West Airport Knock\r\n\r\n50 minutes to Galway City\r\n\r\n1 hour to Sligo\r\n\r\nViewings strictly by appointment only.\r\nContact: Martin Finn Auctioneers, Claremorris, Co. Mayo\r\nTel: 094 9362216 | Licence No.: 002031\r\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD\r\n\r\n Disclaimer: These particulars, including measurements, floor areas and property size, are for guidance only and may contain errors. They are not part of any contract. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided"
      },
